        "id": "F1",
        "severity": "WARNING",
        "location": "engine/runtime/labdrian-runtime-parity-plugin.mjs:296-302",
        "claim": "The 'hooks are not running' notice is lost when the first failing call does not reach a completed result. The gate sets unavailableReported=true and stores the note, but reportToolResult drops the lines for a non-completed (error) call and appendToResult silently drops them for a result with neither a content array nor a string output. The flag is already set, so the notice is never repeated and the session runs unchecked with no notice, contrary to the claim that the first result says so.",
        "evidence_class": "inferential",
        "causal_disposition": "introduced",
        "proof_refs": [
          "engine/runtime/labdrian-runtime-parity-plugin.mjs:298-299",
          "engine/runtime/labdrian-runtime-parity-plugin.mjs:335-344"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "F2",
        "severity": "WARNING",
        "location": "engine/runtime/labdrian-runtime-parity-plugin.mjs:226-229",
        "claim": "A silent engine is retried with a full 30 s timeout on every PreToolUse and every PostToolUse. There is no circuit breaker after the first timeout, so each tool call in a session with a hung engine stalls up to 60 s (sequential calls compound this) while the plugin still fails open.",
        "evidence_class": "inferential",
        "causal_disposition": "introduced",
        "proof_refs": [
          "engine/runtime/labdrian-runtime-parity-plugin.mjs:192",
          "engine/runtime/labdrian-runtime-parity-plugin.mjs:226-229"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "F3",
        "severity": "SUGGESTION",
        "location": "engine/runtime/labdrian-runtime-parity-plugin.mjs:285",
        "claim": "The envelope cwd is process.cwd() of the OpenCode host, not the directory of the session or call. If they differ, the engine binds the workflow to the wrong repository and the gate may allow or deny against the wrong project.",
        "evidence_class": "inferential",
        "causal_disposition": "introduced",
        "proof_refs": [
          "engine/runtime/labdrian-runtime-parity-plugin.mjs:285"
