        "location": "engine/runtime/labdrian-runtime-parity-plugin.mjs:244",
        "claim": "JSON.stringify(envelope) runs inside the Promise executor after the child is spawned. If call.input cannot be serialized (circular reference, BigInt), the promise rejects, which contradicts the 'never rejects' comment. The child and the 30 s timer are left running, and execute.before throws a raw error that blocks the call rather than failing open.",
